#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""hyperwebster-controller-desktop — map a gamepad to Hyprland desktop actions.

Desktop-session only. Never fights Steam GamepadUI / gamescope:
  * exits if gamescope is running or /tmp/.gaming-session-active exists
  * pauses (releases device grab) while a game / Proton / gamescope window
    is focused so Steam Input owns the pad
  * while the session lock is active, switches to PIN / password entry mode
    (uinput digits → LockSurface pam.handleKey)

Requires: python-evdev, membership in the `input` group (for /dev/uinput).
"""
